## 6. 📅 Events Module

### 🔍 Events Page

#### Search قابلیت

Users can search by:

* Title
* Organizer

#### Filters

* Public Free
* Public Paid
* Private Free
* Private Paid

---

### 🧾 Event Card

Displays:

* Title
* Date
* Organizer
* Registration Fee
* View Details Button

---

### 📄 Event Details Page

#### Information প্রদর্শন

* Title
* Date & Time
* Venue / Event Link
* Description
* Organizer
* Registration Fee

---

### 🎯 Action Buttons

| Event Type   | Action          |
| ------------ | --------------- |
| Free Public  | Join instantly  |
| Paid Public  | Pay & Join      |
| Free Private | Request to Join |
| Paid Private | Pay & Request   |

---

### 👑 Owner Controls

Event owner can:

* Approve requests
* Reject requests
* Ban participants
* Edit event
* Delete event

---

## 7. ⭐ Reviews & Ratings

Users can:

* Rate events
* Write reviews
* Edit reviews
* Delete reviews (within allowed period)

---

## 8. 🧑‍💻 Dashboard

### Sidebar

* My Events
* Pending Invitations
* My Reviews
* Settings

---

### 📌 My Events

Users can:

* Create events
* Update events
* Delete events
* View participants
* Manage approvals

---

### ✉️ Invitations

Users can:

* Accept invitation
* Decline invitation
* Pay & Accept (for paid events)

---

### ⭐ Reviews Section

* View reviews
* Edit reviews
* Delete reviews

---

### ⚙️ Settings

Users can update:

* Profile
* Notifications

---

## 9. 🏗️ Event Creation

### Fields

* Title
* Date
* Time
* Venue
* Description
* Public / Private
* Registration Fee

---

## 10. 🎟️ Participation Flow

### Public Events

* Free → Instant Join
* Paid → Payment → Pending Approval

### Private Events

* Free → Request → Approval
* Paid → Payment → Pending Approval

---

## 11. 💳 Payment Workflow

* Payment via SSLCommerz / ShurjoPay
* Paid participation creates **Pending Request**
* Host must approve participation

---

## 12. 🔐 Core Functionalities

* JWT Authentication
* Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)
* Event CRUD Operations
* Participation Management
* Invitation System
* Payment Integration
* Review System

---

## 13. ⚠️ Error Handling

### Validation

* Required fields
* Email validation
* Fee validation

### Loading States

* API loading
* Payment processing

### Error Messages

* Invalid login
* Payment failure
* Unauthorized access

---

## 14. 📈 Future Enhancements (Optional)

* Real-time notifications
* Event analytics dashboard
* Chat system between participants
* QR-based event check-in
* Mobile app version

---

## 15. ✅ Success Metrics

* Number of events created
* User engagement rate
* Event participation rate
* Payment success rate
* Review activity

---

## 🧠 Summary

Planora aims to be a **full-featured event ecosystem** combining:

* Event discovery
* Secure participation
* Flexible payment handling
* Strong admin moderation

It balances **user freedom** with **system control**, making it scalable and production-ready.

---
